[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3569095159","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113090#issuecomment-3569095159","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113090","id":3569095159,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UvBH3","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T06:27:56Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T06:27:56Z","body":"This won't work, in a lot of cases (pretty much any freshly installed app), macOS Gatekeeper will apply app translocation, and the app will see itself running in the isolated virtual filesystem under `/private/var/...`. It can't get its real location in any way, so reading this file will be impossible. This is done specifically done as a security measure to prevent doing stuff like this, and prevent calling external apps to modify content of the app (since `/private/var/...` is only valid for the app itself).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3569095159/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3569658367","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113090#issuecomment-3569658367","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113090","id":3569658367,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UxKn_","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T09:09:17Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T09:13:11Z","body":"I should also mention that placing anything _next to_ `.app` bundles is _very_ frowned upon in the macOS world, since everything lives in `/Applications` and is neatly organized by default (just `.app` \"files\", nothing else).\nWhile it's true that many players likely won't know `.app` is a bundle, I don't think it is a huge problem to explain that they need to right click the `.app` to introspect its contents.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3569658367/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3569712856","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113090#issuecomment-3569712856","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113090","id":3569712856,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UxX7Y","user":{"login":"Qubus0","id":51323316,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMzIzMzE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51323316?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0","html_url":"https://github.com/Qubus0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T09:21:23Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T09:21:23Z","body":"Hm if it is blocked by security then I don't know why custom gdscript is able to access it so easily. \n\nIn that case user:// can still be accessed, which I find to be a neater way as well, compared to inside the bundle.\n\nYes the neat sorting in /Applications is true for most general apps, but Steam, Itch, and Epic all install to their very own folders, steam even giving each game their own folder. Steam might actually be dissolving the bundle now that I think about it, or just doesn't end it with .app","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3569712856/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3569726648","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113090#issuecomment-3569726648","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113090","id":3569726648,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UxbS4","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T09:24:43Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T09:24:43Z","body":"> Hm if it is blocked by security then I don't know why custom gdscript is able to access it so easily.\n\nIt depends on how the app is installed. If it's a locally built app or installed by something like Steam, translocation also won't be enabled. Also, if the app was manually moved by the user after first run, translocation is disabled.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3569726648/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3569732495","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113090#issuecomment-3569732495","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113090","id":3569732495,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UxcuP","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T09:26:13Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T09:37:00Z","body":">  Steam might actually be dissolving the bundle now that I think about it, or just doesn't end it with .app\n\nSteam also uses `.app` bundles:\n\n<img width=\"675\" height=\"307\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/50f35842-500c-4009-b926-ad41f8dce766\" />\n\nNote that `.app` really _is_ an actual folder on macOS. Finder just displays it as if it were a file. There's no reason to avoid `.app` on a technical level.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3569732495/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3570059499","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113090#issuecomment-3570059499","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113090","id":3570059499,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Uysjr","user":{"login":"Qubus0","id":51323316,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMzIzMzE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51323316?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0","html_url":"https://github.com/Qubus0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T10:39:12Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T10:39:12Z","body":"> Installed by steam or moved\n\nSo for most cases it's a very valid possibility for a game to not have translocation enabled? Unless specifically installed through the AppStore, most games I have installed don't land in /Applications.\n\nThis also doesn't invalidate checking for an override in user:// if next to .app is deemed too unruly.\n\n> Steam uses bundles\n\nAh looks like that is per game, just the two I had a quick look at didn't use .app 😄 sampling bias\n\nI'm also not saying it should only check for overrides outside the bundle, I think it makes sense to have both. Or all three even, user:// could also be useful on other OS\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3570059499/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3570148571","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113090#issuecomment-3570148571","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113090","id":3570148571,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UzCTb","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T10:57:59Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T10:57:59Z","body":"`user://` is accessible for writing to any app, allowing overrides in it is a potential vulnerability that can be easily exploited, and should not be considered at all.\n\nAdding `override.cfg` to the bundle will break app signature, so technically also won't work for any properly distributed app, but pretty irrelevant for Steam, since 99% of mac games are not signed.\n\nSo instructions should be:\n- Add files to the bundle.\n- Re-sign bundle with your own ad-hoc signature (not an Apple account, just self-signed for a specific machine).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3570148571/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3576952191","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113090#issuecomment-3576952191","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113090","id":3576952191,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VM_V_","user":{"login":"Qubus0","id":51323316,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMzIzMzE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51323316?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0","html_url":"https://github.com/Qubus0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Qubus0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-25T18:16:04Z","updated_at":"2025-11-25T18:16:04Z","body":"> Re-sign bundle with your own ad-hoc signature\n\ngood thing that this isn't really required to launch the application, it's just not trusted. i've personally never even done it and i don't think making completely inexperienced people deal with command line stuff is a reasonable requirement tbh\n\n> user:// is accessible for writing to any app, allowing overrides in it is a potential vulnerability that can be easily exploited, and should not be considered at all.\n\nhow is this different from allowing an override.cfg placed next to an exe on windows? isn't that also accessible for writing for everything? not a windows expert so let me know if that assumption is wrong","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3576952191/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3576990029","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113090#issuecomment-3576990029","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113090","id":3576990029,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VNIlN","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-25T18:27:35Z","updated_at":"2025-11-25T18:27:35Z","body":"> isn't that also accessible for writing for everything? not a windows expert so let me know if that assumption is wrong\n\nIf I remember correctly, normal places for apps, like `Program Files` should be writable only by admin users, `SYSTEM` and `TrustedInstaller`, normal users only have read + execute permission.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3576990029/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]